  "comments": [
    {
      "position": 0,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Note this form shortens in a similar way to てしまう。\nては→ちゃ\nでは→じゃ",
      "html": "Note this form shortens in a similar way to てしまう。<br/>ては→ちゃ<br/>では→じゃ",
      "credits_raw": "Amatuka",
      "content_sha256": "0b11b459d0ae22785086e05caeef9363ee7b2212ce3b67248890f0e24bde8a09",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 1,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Formed from te-form verb + ha (wa)\n\nVte = te-form verb",
      "html": "Formed from te-form verb + ha (wa)<br/><br/>Vte = te-form verb",
      "credits_raw": "Amatuka",
      "content_sha256": "2e5873f647a3fc66a92b7d73274fa9936e5f319404e17e9229e9097e12a3ffdd",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "The first sentence is the same as 死んではいけない/ならい:\nYou must not die!",
      "html": "The first sentence is the same as 死んではいけない/ならい:<br/>You must not die!",
      "credits_raw": "anon",
      "content_sha256": "66ca4c4a8eb83f0b3ee71db754deeaa7b9699a0a1b1fbb896afad9f34baf9bfa",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "I'm sorry, but what is the exact usage of this phrasing?",
      "html": "I'm sorry, but what is the exact usage of this phrasing?",
      "credits_raw": "anon",
      "content_sha256": "f0ca9d29ae4aa2e364492e60dab6273558dbf2a5648d98725b1c2f889a605315",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "I read somewhere that the te form is considered a noun. I find that a useful thing to keep in mind in cases like this ては...",
      "html": "I read somewhere that the te form is considered a noun. I find that a useful thing to keep in mind in cases like this ては...",
      "credits_raw": "yookoso",
      "content_sha256": "2aef5bb2d86732c19b50a181ed4cb76ba4e4fb631a8fce113aa1d59ad333b79c",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 5,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "I guess this just means \"doing (this) would be...\" \n\nThe two examples given (だめ、まずい）are negative. Can this be used positively?\n例：行っては素晴らしい。\n行っちゃ素晴らしい。",
      "html": "I guess this just means \"doing (this) would be...\" <br/><br/>The two examples given (だめ、まずい）are negative. Can this be used positively?<br/>例：行っては素晴らしい。<br/>行っちゃ素晴らしい。",
      "credits_raw": "ljfurlong",
      "content_sha256": "35b2bbb1374521d7057c326c698ce68fcacc18b94ab233cc2405f4e89129e833",
      "original_created_at": null,
